    "text": "Punjab mein baldiyati elections do marhalon mein honge! 🗳️\nDawn ke mutabiq Election Commission of Pakistan (ECP) ne Punjab hukoomat ki tajweez manzoor kar li hai. February 2027 mein hone wale local government elections do phases mein honge, aur har phase mein 18 districts shamil honge. Pehle phase mein Lahore, Rawalpindi, Sialkot aur Bahawalpur samet 18 districts hain, jabke doosre phase mein Faisalabad, Multan, Gujranwala aur Rahim Yar Khan samet 18 districts hain. Punjab mein pichle baldiyati elections 2015 mein hue the.\nKya aap apne ilaqe ke local elections mein vote denge? Comment mein batayein 👇\n\nImage: AI-generated illustration.\n\n#RiseUpPakistan #Punjab #LocalElections #ECP #PakistanNews",
